<h2>How the case reached the Division Bench</h2>
<div class="flow">
  <div class="fstep"><strong>2023–2024:</strong> NIA registers a case; the petitioner is arrested in March 2024. The ED records an ECIR in September 2024 and formally arrests him in October 2024 while he is already in judicial custody.</div>
